{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QPartitionCombinatorics"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.exists_subpartition_of_size","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.exists_subpartition_of_size","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CombinerBranchingCompleteness.lean#L122-L137","doc":"**Combiner non-degeneracy (Frobenius reciprocity completeness).**  Every\ncanonical positive partition `λ` of size `≥ k` has a sub-partition `μ ⊆ λ` of\nsize `|λ| − k` — so the branching `H_{|λ|−k}(q) ⊗ H_k(q) ↪ H_{|λ|}(q)`\nreaches `λ` (its `interface_blocks` enumeration is non-empty), and the\noperator-valued combiner drops no Wedderburn block. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.dropLastBox_sum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.dropLastBox_sum","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CombinerBranchingCompleteness.lean#L97-L120","doc":"On a canonical positive partition with at least one box, `dropLastBox`\nlowers the size by exactly one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.dropLastBox_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.dropLastBox_pos","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CombinerBranchingCompleteness.lean#L77-L95","doc":"`dropLastBox` preserves positivity of the parts. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.dropLastBox_sub","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.dropLastBox_sub","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CombinerBranchingCompleteness.lean#L58-L75","doc":"`dropLastBox l ⊆ l` (pointwise; no positivity needed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.dropLastBox","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.dropLastBox","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CombinerBranchingCompleteness.lean#L51-L56","doc":"Remove one Young box from the last nonempty row (drop it if it was a unit\nrow).  On a canonical positive partition this lowers the size by exactly 1. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.IsSubPartition.trans","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.IsSubPartition.trans","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CombinerBranchingCompleteness.lean#L47-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.IsSubPartition.refl","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.IsSubPartition.refl","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CombinerBranchingCompleteness.lean#L44-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.IsSubPartition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidsAndKnots.CombinerBranchingCompleteness.IsSubPartition","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidsAndKnots/CombinerBranchingCompleteness.lean#L40-L42","doc":"Young-diagram containment `ξ ⊆ λ`, pointwise: `ξ.getD i 0 ≤ λ.getD i 0`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}